### exchange-rate-service: курс EUR
GET http://localhost:8081/rates/EUR

### exchange-rate-service: 1200 грн у EUR
GET http://localhost:8081/rates/EUR/convert?amountUah=1200

### exchange-rate-service: невідома валюта (404)
GET http://localhost:8081/rates/XYZ

### notification-service: нове сповіщення (202)
POST http://localhost:8082/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{"recipient": "guest@gmail.com", "subject": "Booking 4", "message": "Your booking is confirmed"}

### notification-service: відхилений отримувач (422)
POST http://localhost:8082/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{"recipient": "broken@hotel.invalid", "subject": "Booking 5", "message": "Hi"}

### notification-service: історія
GET http://localhost:8082/notifications

### health: exchange-rate-service
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/health

### health: notification-service
GET http://localhost:8082/actuator/health